    "html_id": null,
    "disposition": "retained_unformalised"
  },
  {
    "id": "interim.text.2105",
    "text": "The Company’s future gross margins can be impacted by a variety of factors, as discussed in Part I, Item 1A of the 2024 Form 10-K and Part II, Item 1A of this Form 10-Q, in each case under the heading “Risk Factors.” As a result, the Company believes, in general, gross margins will be subject to volatility and downward pressure.",
